Manus Sudrenus is a sleek, high-elven aristocrat with silver hair tied back in a silken ribbon, dressed in flowing dark silk robes.

Manus is a member of [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]], and stands at its head among the Org's people aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]].
